→ Fixed: point moved to `[1022, 614, "Pharmacy waiting bay: the alcove the counter wall steps back to make (x 1009-1034, y 583-637), east of the aisle 34-38 corridor"]`.

**2. No `must_not` for the 104 m² enclosed room on the west wall (x 88–138, y 500–701).** (walk_truth point)
